        "Microstructure_Text": {
          "original": "The α’ martensite, typical of LB-PBF Ti-6Al-4V, is observed before HIP. Needle-like alpha laths are observed within the prior beta grains; prior beta grains exhibit epitaxial growth parallel to the build direction of the specimens. Backscatter and EBSD images of vertically built 90° specimens before HIP were used to approximate average lath statistics.",
          "simplified": "Before HIP, the as-manufactured LB-PBF Ti-6Al-4V shows α′ martensite with needle-like alpha laths inside prior beta grains, and prior beta grains grow epitaxially parallel to the build direction."
